  "description": "# ⚔️ DREAM UNDEAD\n### Part of the DREAM ALLIANCE ✨ \nGuilds for every level for smooth and fast progression 📈\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n        \n      \n⚠️ READ BIO BEFORE APPLYING OR BE REJECTED ❌\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### REQUIREMENTS 📋\n- Combat level 70+ ⚔️\n- Stockpile or challenges 5000g daily 💰\n- Kicked after 4 days inactive 📉\n- Discord required 💬\n\n### RAID TIMES ⏰\n- Early: 12PM CET ☀️\n- Late: 8PM CET 🌙\n- Extra: 9:10PM CET🌙 (Only Friday-Sunday)\n\n### BENEFITS 🎁\n- Two daily raids + One extra raid during weekend and events ⚔️\n- Giveaways &amp; guides 📚\n- World Boss &amp; Shooting Star pings 🔔\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### RECRUITMENT OPEN ✅\n #### discord.gg/h4NhRWmDsp 🔗",
